	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nAs Suggested in the datasheet, TIMER and TIMER_OFF were connected to 100n capacitors. This allows us to open the circuit in 10ms and retry after a delay of 200ms. For automatic retries, the nFAULT was connected to the ENABLE pin.\nThese are pulled up to VCAP with a 15k resistor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 384.81 43.18 0)
		(size 21.59 36.83)
		(margins 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525)
		(stroke
