	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nThe number of time the e-fuse can retry is set at 16 and the delay between retries is maximised by using the capacitor values in the table provided by TI.\n\nIMON pin is not used as we already have sensing, it is wired as recommended in the datasheet.\n\nThe duration of overcurrent can be set using the capacitor connected to ITimer. We want the shortest possible duration so we leave the pin open\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 238.76 0)
		(size 58.42 27.94)
		(margins 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525 1.3525)
